Format Sounio source code

Usage: souc-linux-x86_64 fmt [OPTIONS] <PATH>

Arguments:
  <PATH>  Input file (or directory)

Options:
      --check                        Check formatting without modifying files
      --diff                         Show diff of changes
      --max-width <MAX_WIDTH>        Maximum line width [default: 100]
      --use-tabs                     Use tabs instead of spaces
      --indent-width <INDENT_WIDTH>  Indent width (number of spaces) [default: 4]
  -v, --verbose                      Enable verbose output
  -h, --help                         Print help
